<title>UK: World Bank sets 1.0 trln lire 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 1.0 trln lire 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banca Nazionale del Lavora.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    01.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE    DOMESTIC     ISS PRICE  51.70     PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.3	 LISTING    **	  YTM	   6.82</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) FIVE	GOV LAW     ITALIAN</p>
<p> NOTES    PUBLIC OFFER THROUGH SYNDICATE MEMBERS FROM 20.JAN.97</p>
<p>	  **ITALIAN STOCK EXCHANGE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
